86XomGc","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-15T18:51:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-15T18:51:17Z","body":"moving this to Later Release for now. Not sure if 11 packages in Fedora is enough to consider this for SPDX due to the complications this could raise for general use in SPDX community in terms of defining it. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2544001436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3644089241","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294#issuecomment-3644089241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294","id":3644089241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87ZNGOZ","user":{"login":"WillGreen","id":752069,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjA2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/752069?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen","html_url":"https://github.com/WillGreen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WillGreen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-11T22:40:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T22:40:00Z","body":"I've just been adding colour palettes to a project and was trying to choose and SPDX identifier for them. Not-Copyrightable seems potentially appropriate.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3644089241/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3791972132","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294#issuecomment-3791972132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294","id":3791972132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87iBOck","user":{"login":"villesundell","id":7301727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDE3Mjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7301727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell","html_url":"https://github.com/villesundell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/villesundell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T19:28:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T19:28:56Z","body":"Hello everyone! 👋 \nI have two usecases for this:\n  1. AI content. When I use AI, most of the produced content is probably not copyrightable anyway. I would like to signal others that I think the work does not enjoy copyright protection, and clear the ambiguity from my part.\n  2. I have public domain code by a third party that I would like to flag public domain. I can't use CC0 as I am not the author.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3791972132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/4137018336","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294#issuecomment-4137018336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2294","id":4137018336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE872lePg","user":{"login":"kpcyrd","id":7763184,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NjMxODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7763184?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd","html_url":"https://github.com/kpcyrd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kpcyrd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T17:55:32Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T17:55:32Z","body":"> When I use AI, most of the produced content is probably not copyrightable anyway.\n\nWhile I believe AI content should belong in the public domain, I still think it's a good idea to include a permission slip in form of an open source license.\n\nIf you are in a jurisdiction that considers LLM output as not-copyrightable you don't lose anything by doing so (\"thanks for the permission but I didn't need it\"), and all license conditions/restrictions (if any) are ineffective/optional.\n\nBut in a jurisdiction that has different laws, or if any jurisdiction ever changes their laws, the code is suddenly \"proprietary all rights reserved\" if you didn't include a license saying otherwise.\n\nThe concept of \"I'm placing this work in the public domain\" is similar, because not all jurisdictions recognize the concept of \"waiving copyright\", it would still be considered \"proprietary all rights reserved\" in those countries, see \"The problem\" on this page: https://creativecommons.org/public-domain/cc0/\n\n> I have public domain code by a third party that I would like to flag public domain\n\nThis is different from not-copyrightable, the work most likely is copyrightable but the third-party has either waived their copyright, or the copyright has expired (which is unlikely, if somebody wrote a computer program on 1970 and then immediately died afterwards, it's still 14 more years until you could use this code in your project, and even then you wouldn't be able to distribute your project in Jamaica until 2065).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/4137018336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]